    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baana na babyaji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we baana ng'widohya kūlwa ng'wa Seeba ū kū babyaji bing'we, nguno ū mhayo gwenūyū gūtūngīlīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo sha kwandya īsho shilī na wisagījiwa shihayile gīkī, “Nkūjage so na noko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "h'ikūkūbeelela ī mihayo; hama ūkūbiza na būlamu būlīhu ū mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we basaabo yaya ū kūbasaayīcha a baana bing'we, alīyo ng'ūbatongeela mu kalangīle na kahūgūlīle ka ng'wa Seeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basese na basaabo būgonzo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'we basese ng'widohya ū kū basīng'we būgonzo mu mīlī; bizagi n'ikūjo na logohano, nū mung'holò jing'we mubize na kwifunya gītī kūlī Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūtūmama chiza ūlū balīmubona dūhū, gītī mulī na ng'hūmbū ja kūyeja banhū. Alīyo ītagi ī milīmo gītī mulī basese ba ng'wa Kilisito, ng'wīyīta nang'holò īmò īyo yīnyegije Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmamagi na moyo gwape gītī mulīntūmamīla Seeba, ītī gītī mukūbatūmamīlaga banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mumanile gīkī būlī ng'wene akwanukūla mheela kūfuma kūlī Seeba, kūlwa milīmo yawiza īyo akwītaga; abize nsese nūūlū alī mu wiyabī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we basaabo būgonzo bīītīlagi gīko a basese bing'we, yaya ū kūbadūkagūla. Managi gīkī ū Seeba wabo ūyo alī ng'wigūlū, ūyo na a bing'we alī wing'we, atīītīlaga banhū mhayo mu būsolanhya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wilwisha wa bazunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū gwa kūmalīja gūlī gīkī, handatīlagi ū mulī Seeba nū mu nguzu ja būdūla bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zwalīlagi pyī ī shilanga sha ng'wa Mulungu, hū mukūdūla kwilwisha nayo ī nyasala sala ya Ng'wanishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wilwisha wise būtī bo kwilwisha na mīlī, nūūlū mininga. Tūlī na wilwisha na mabūsugi, hamò na mabūdūla mataale. Tūkūlwaga na basugi ba mu sī ī ya giiti īyī, mabita ga myoyo misoso ya mu mapandī ga ng'wigūlū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, shizwalīlagi pyī ī shilanga sha ng'wa Mulungu, mubize na būdūla bo kwīmīīla hīgīyī ū mu lūshikū lwabūbi; hama ūlū ng'wamalamaja ū kwīyīta pyī ī yose, handatīlagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana īmīīlagi hīgīyī, ī ng'hana ng'wīyitunge gītī nshipi mu mikīmbīlī ying'we. Nū būtūngīlīja mubūzwalīle; ū wene hū būkūmulang'hana gītī shizwalo sha chūma kū shikuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo mubize mumalīīlile, ī mhola ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza ng'wīzwale gītī shilatū kū mhambala jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu būlī mhayo gose na gose bizagi na kūzunya, mukūdime gītī lūmūda, hū mukūdūla ū kūgajimya pye a masonga ga moto a ga Ng'wanishi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama būdimagi ū būpīji, nguno ī lyenīlo līl'ihima ling'we; nū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu, ūyo gūlī lūshū lo ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lombagi būl'ikanza mu nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo, mu kalombele kose na kwikūmbīlīja kwa būlī mbika. Nīyo bizagi miso ū kū mhayo gwenūyo, mukomeele ū kūbalombela pye a beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nene ng'ūnilombela ninhwe mhayo, nongeje kūgūtūmamīla ū nomo gwane mu būgimu, nīkumūche ī mbisīla ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene ī haha nalī ntūmami ntungwa kūlwa nīmo gwenūyo. Nilombelagi nabize na būdūla bo kūlomeela mu būgimu gīt'ūmo shinigeleelilwe kwīta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgīsha bo kūmalīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ndūgū Tikiko ng'wene ntūmami ng'wishigwa wa ng'wa Seeba, h'ūyo akūmumanīkīja pyī ī mihayo yane, ning'we mumane ūmo nakūjīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīntūma kūlwa nguno ya mhayo gwenūyo, gīkī amumanīkīje ī mihayo yise; ning'we mulūngūjiwe ū mung'holò jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhola na būtogwa na kūsanya shibize hamò ning'we badūgū, kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe na Seeba Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo shibize hamò na bose abo bantogilwe Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, mu būtogwa būtī bo kūkenaagūka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
